        "gg0pazeKOUU_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>P13 vs. F13 Pro: Which One Fits Your Business?</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While both printers deliver exceptional DTF results, they serve different purposes depending on your business scale and printing needs. Below are key parameters to help you choose the right fit:</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "gg1KgxUl2Lm_text": "<p><strong>Print Speed</strong></p>",
        "gg3O0BYUyee_text": "<p>For entrepreneurs looking to start a creative side hustle from home, the P13 DTF Printer is your ideal home startup solution. Designed specifically for home-based businesses, the P13 combines elegant aesthetics with high-performance printing capabilities. Whether you're a professional looking to diversify your income, a designer seeking precision, or a creative mom starting a business from home, the P13 makes it easy to create beautiful, high-quality prints in a peaceful and inspiring environment.</p>",
        "gg3fmW8TNkQ_text": "<p>XP600</p>",
        "gg48gK7mRbI_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>P13: Perfect for Home-Based Startups</strong></span></p><p>Designed specifically for home-based entrepreneurs, the P13 DTF Printer delivers quiet operation and superior print quality. With a single printhead, it handles up to 350+ orders per week – ideal for entrepreneurs just getting started. Its warm wood grain design fits seamlessly into any home workspace, creating a peaceful and productive environment for printing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>F13 Pro: Ideal for High-Volume Small Businesses</strong></span></p><p>Built for small businesses that demand speed and high output, the F13Pro DTF Printer features dual printheads that deliver faster speeds and industrial-grade quality. Capable of handling 450+ orders per week, it is the perfect solution for businesses that require quick turnaround and consistent, high-quality prints.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>Spring Promotion: Limited-Time Offers on P13 &amp; F13Pro</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>To help you start the season strong, we are offering exclusive spring promotions on both the P13 DTF Printer and F13 Pro DTF Printer. Whether you are just beginning your DTF journey or looking to scale up with a trusted brand, now is the perfect time to invest. Don’t miss out on these limited-time offers:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>P13 Spring Promotion</strong></span></p><p>All <a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/products/procolored-p13-dtf-printer\">P13</a> bundles are available at a special promotional price, with savings of up to $700! Choose the bundle that best fits your business needs and enjoy premium P13 DTF printing at a more accessible price point.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>F13 Pro Spring Promotion</strong></span></p><p>The <a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/products/products-13-dual-heads-dtf-pro-a3-dtf-printer-direct-to-film-printer-upgrade\">F13 Pro</a> comes with two exclusive pricing tiers designed to reward both new and returning customers. Simply log in to your account to unlock your eligible discount automatically.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>New Customer Offer</strong></span></p><p>If you’ve never purchased a Procolored machine before, simply log in, and you’ll automatically get up to $950 off on your F13 Pro purchase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Returning Customer Offer</strong></span></p><p>If you’ve already purchased a Procolored machine, regardless of model. As a thank you for your continued trust, you can enjoy up to $1050 discount on your F13 Pro purchase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Important Note</strong></span></p><p>The clock is ticking, and these offers won’t last long. Act now to make the most of the spring season and take your business to new heights!</p><p>Whether you’re looking for a quiet, aesthetically pleasing solution for your home-based venture or a high-performance printer for rapid growth, the P13 and F13Pro have you covered.</p>",
        "gg66LbDl6Lv_text": "<p><strong>Noise Level</strong></p>",
        "gg83wNWmkLK_text": "<p>50% quieter than industrial&nbsp;</p>",
