        "ggKQcmm3ScK_text": "<ol><li>Introduction: Your 2026 DTF Business Solution</li><li>P13: Quiet Creation, Built for Home-Based Startups</li><li>F13 Pro: Instant Returns, Fueling High-Volume Production</li><li>P13 vs. F13 Pro: Which One Fits Your Business?</li><li>Spring Promotion: Limited-Time Offers on P13 &amp; F13 Pro</li><li>Why Now Is the Perfect Time to Invest</li></ol>",
