        "ggMygco2FY2_text": "<p>F13 Pro</p>",
        "ggP0o5NLC9Z_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Key Features</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dual Print Heads</strong></p><p>At the heart of the F13 Pro is its innovative dual print head array. Two print heads work together to deliver a faster, more efficient printing process. Spend less time waiting and more time maximizing output. With this configuration, an A3-size pattern is completed in about 5 minutes – making it the true speed king of DTF printing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>High-Efficiency Production</strong></p><p>Weekly output easily exceeds 450 pieces, allowing you to significantly boost your business income. Whether you are fulfilling bulk orders or scaling up your production capacity, the F13 Pro delivers the throughput you need to grow.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Superior Print Quality</strong></p><p>With advanced color management, the F13 Pro can create high-resolution prints with minimal color distortion, ensuring consistent, industrial-grade results with enhanced color depth and print detail.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Sleek, Mobile Design</strong></p><p>The F13Pro can be paired with a movable stand, allowing for easy relocation in your workspace without taking up too much room. It’s a versatile solution for growing businesses with limited space.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Smart Features for Hassle-Free Operation</strong></p><ul><li>Auto-Cleaning Printhead: Automatically cleans the printhead every 10 hours, using just 1ml of ink daily, ensuring optimal performance with no manual maintenance required.</li><li>White Ink Circulation: Maintains steady ink flow, preventing clogs and ensuring vibrant, sharp prints while extending the printer's lifespan.</li><li>Printhead Protection: A photoelectric detection system to minimize risks from uneven film, protecting the printhead and extending its service life.</li></ul><p><strong>Summary</strong></p><p>With its exceptional speed, high efficiency, and user-friendly features, the F13 Pro DTF Printer is the ultimate tool for entrepreneurs looking to maximize their returns and scale their business quickly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggPDMn29wnv_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:26px;\"><strong>F13 Pro: Instant Returns, Fueling High-Volume Production</strong></span></p>",
        "ggSE9IU2B95_text": "<p><strong>Color Configuration</strong></p>",
        "ggSHnXmFcuo_text": "<p>Letter/A4:7 min</p>",
