        "ggUx7xDa5UA_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/F.png",
        "ggXVyTcVVK3_text": "Subscribe",
        "ggYCuB8_DAE_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>Why Now Is the Perfect Time to Invest</strong></span></p><p>As demand for personalized products and custom designs continues to grow, now is the perfect time to enter the DTF printing business. The P13 and F13Pro don’t just upgrade your equipment — they help you turn production into profit. Whether you’re starting small or scaling up, these printers give you the power to grow faster and earn more.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Choose Your Path:</p><p>Exploring the <a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/products/procolored-p13-dtf-printer\">P13</a> – For quiet, high-performance, and beautifully done</p><p>Exploring the <a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/products/products-13-dual-heads-dtf-pro-a3-dtf-printer-direct-to-film-printer-upgrade\">F13 Pro</a> – For speed, high-volume, and faster returns</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Order your P13 DTF Printer or F13Pro DTF Printer today and start printing your way to success.</p>",
        "ggZh3Z54tpd_text": "<p>To join our mailing list</p><p>and never miss our updates !</p>",
        "gg_9PdIVGz-_placeholder": "Email",
        "ggadDawpkbm_text": "<p>Most Popular Blogs</p>",
        "ggbcx3bD0an_text": "<p><strong>Printhead Configuration</strong></p>",
        "ggbxye-NCZR_label": "Subscribe Now",
        "ggcJHT6rHO__text": "<p>450+orders/week</p>",
        "ggd3ljE2d2j_text": "<p><strong>Prints per hour</strong></p>",
        "ggdv8Kt8gVB_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Key Features</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Elegant Aesthetic Design</strong></p><p>With its refined wood grain finish and smooth rounded corners, the P13 adds a touch of warmth to your home. The transparent Panda-patterned lid not only adds a unique touch but also includes built-in lighting, allowing you to monitor your prints in real-time without lifting the lid.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Superior Print Quality</strong></p><p>G7 certified for color accuracy, the P13 ensures stunning, multi-colored prints with fine details. It effortlessly handles complex designs, printing them in one go without requiring additional post-processing, saving you valuable time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>High Production Capacity</strong></p><p>Powered by the XP600 printhead, the P13 prints quickly with excellent output, allowing you to print A3-sized designs in about 10 minutes. With the ability to print over 50 items per day and up to 350 per week, it's ideal for handling bulk orders efficiently.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Less Noise</strong></p><p>The P13 is engineered to operate quietly. Sound-absorbing foam lines the cable chains, making it approximately 50% quieter than traditional DTF printers. This design ensures that you can work in a peaceful environment, enhancing both your productivity and mood.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Large Print Area</strong></p><p>The P13 supports A3 size printing, accommodating a wide range of garment sizes from S to 4XL, making it perfect for creating custom apparel like T-shirts, hoodies, and more.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Smart Features for Hassle-Free Operation</strong></p><ul><li>Automatic Cleaning System: Offers 12/24/36-hour sleep mode timers, reducing ink waste by up to 58% while maintaining printhead health.</li><li>Laser Detection: Automatically detects film flatness to prevent printhead scratches, reducing maintenance costs.</li><li>Waste Ink Alarm: Prevents ink spills and keeps your workspace clean.</li></ul><p><strong>Summary</strong></p><p>With its aesthetic design, quiet operation, and efficient printing capabilities, the P13 DTF Printer is ideal for home-based entrepreneurs building a beautiful and profitable printing business.</p>",
        "ggfahVThmDY_text": "<p>For entrepreneurs seeking quick returns and high-volume production, the F13 Pro DTF Printer is designed to deliver exceptional results in the shortest time. Whether you're running a small-scale business or scaling up, the F13 Pro’s performance accelerates your business growth with unmatched speed and efficiency.</p>",
